{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_5", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_5.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Really?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "A discovery of yours?", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "A discovery of mine.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "(Walks up and down.)", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Just let them come saying, as usual, that it is all fancy and a crazy man's imagination!", "para": 2, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "But they will be careful what they say this time, I can tell you!", "para": 2, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "But, father, tell us what it is.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, yes\u2014only give me time, and you shall know all about it.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "If only I had Peter here now!", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "It just shows how we men can go about forming our judgments, when in reality we are as blind as any moles\u2014", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "What are you driving at, Doctor?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (standing still by the table).", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Isn't it the universal opinion that our town is a healthy spot?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite an unusually healthy spot, in fact\u2014a place that deserves to be recommended in the warmest possible manner either for invalids or for people who are well\u2014", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but my dear Thomas\u2014", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "And we have been recommending it and praising it\u2014I have written and written, both in the \"Messenger\" and in pamphlets...", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, what then?", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "And the Baths\u2014we have called them the \"main artery of the town's life-blood,\" the \"nerve-centre of our town,\" and the devil knows what else\u2014", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "\"The town's pulsating heart\" was the expression I once used on an important occasion.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, do you know what they really are, these great, splendid, much praised Baths, that have cost so much money\u2014do you know what they are?", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "No, what are they?", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, what are they?", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "The whole place is a pest-house!", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "The Baths, father?", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (at the same time), Our Baths?", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "But, Doctor\u2014", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Absolutely incredible!", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "The whole Bath establishment is a whited, poisoned sepulchre, I tell you\u2014the gravest possible danger to the public health!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "All the nastiness up at Molledal, all that stinking filth, is infecting the water in the conduit-pipes leading to the reservoir; and the same cursed, filthy poison oozes out on the shore too\u2014", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Where the bathing-place is?", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Just there.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "How do you come to be so certain of all this, Doctor?", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "I have investigated the matter most conscientiously.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "For a long time past I have suspected something of the kind.", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Last year we had some very strange cases of illness among the visitors\u2014typhoid cases, and cases of gastric fever\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that is quite true.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "At the time, we supposed the visitors had been infected before they came; but later on, in the winter, I began to have a different opinion; and so I set myself to examine the water, as well as I could.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Then that is what you have been so busy with?", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Indeed I have been busy, Katherine.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "But here I had none of the necessary scientific apparatus; so I sent samples, both of the drinking-water and of the sea-water, up to the University, to have an accurate analysis made by a chemist.", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "And have you got that?", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (showing him the letter).", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Here it is!", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "It proves the presence of decomposing organic matter in the water\u2014it is full of infusoria.", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "The water is absolutely dangerous to use, either internally or externally.", "para": 32, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "What a mercy you discovered it in time.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "You may well say so.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "And what do you propose to do now, Doctor?", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "To see the matter put right, naturally.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Can that be done?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "It must be done.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Otherwise the Baths will be absolutely useless and wasted.", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "But we need not anticipate that; I have a very clear idea what we shall have to do.", "para": 38, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "But why have you kept this all so secret, dear?", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you suppose I was going to run about the town gossiping about it, before I had absolute proof?", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "No, thank you.", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "I am not such a fool.", "para": 40, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Still, you might have told us\u2014", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Not a living soul.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "But tomorrow you may run around to the old Badger\u2014", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, Thomas!", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Thomas!", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, to your grandfather, then.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "The old boy will have something to be astonished at!", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "I know he thinks I am cracked\u2014and there are lots of other people who think so too, I have noticed.", "para": 44, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "But now these good folks shall see\u2014they shall just see!", "para": 44, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "(Walks about, rubbing his hands.)", "para": 44, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "There will be a nice upset in the town, Katherine; you can't imagine what it will be.", "para": 44, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "All the conduit-pipes will have to be relaid.", "para": 44, "sent": 7, "present": []}]}